            "review_title": "Review at Pizza Giang",
            "review_text": "Kartallio\n44 contributions\n0\nMediocre at best!\nJan 2019 • Family\nHad a “large” three cheese pizza for 180k thinking it would be enough for at least 2p. But don’t be fooled by the “large”, the size is only 12” (30cm). The bottom is also very doughy and not crisp at all. I’ve had better prepared pizzas in Nha Trang restaurants for just 90k which were also 12” (30cm). The fried tuna was decent for 70k, comes with some salad and french fries. I found the bahn mi from the oven (35k) to be to hard and dry. They really need to work on their food preparation and make the ”large” their regular pizza for the regular price.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 23, 2019",
