            "review_title": "Review at Pizza Giang",
            "review_text": "Evdikimov_Sergei\n16 contributions\n0\nBad experiences. This was a rag, not pizza\nMay 2018\nI was in this pizzaria many times, that’s why I know exactly what is their pizza. And the last time was terrible, absolutely terrible. I came to there after a hard working day. I hoped I could have a normal dinner with my girlfriend, and I chose this one, where I had been for several times. It took 25m for waiting, my dinner had been brought out. I remember that I had ordered a pizza, 2juices, 1 fried sake but... this pizza was so bad, it was a rag that I could not pick it up because all things felt down ( as my picture). Ok, sometime we have some unexpected problems. I asked the waitress what is it, why your pizza likes this?? She said “ we ảre sorry, because of the cheese, that’s why this pizza likes this. If we baked longer, it would be burned”. So what will you do to solve this problem, how can I have it??? She took to kitchen and brought back this pizza which had been warmed again in microwave oven. It was worse. How dare you to serve your guest like this. ??? So poor service. So lucky that my friends came to here later a little bit and had the same problem. I thought that I was so lucky but by this time, we were both lucky. NEVER COME BACK.\nRead more\nWritten May 27, 2018",
